---
description: Never attribute commits to Cursor Agent
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor Agent in git history

- NEVER add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent`, or any Cursor/Agent trailer to commits.
- NEVER use author/committer name or email containing Cursor, cursoragent, or @cursor.com.
- When committing, strip any such trailers if the environment injects them — prefer `git commit-tree` rewrite over leaving them.
- Do not amend/push commits that would reintroduce Cursor as a co-author or contributor on GitHub.
